WEBVTT

00:10:27.039 --> 00:10:31.126
But a major reason
is public lack of awareness,

00:10:31.126 --> 00:10:35.297
even misinformation
about the value of unions.

00:10:36.757 --> 00:10:38.926
Well before President Reagan

00:10:38.926 --> 00:10:42.930
fired the striking
air controllers in 1981,

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:47.810
there has been concerted and continuous
opposition by employers and politicians

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.687
to undermine unions.

00:10:50.145 --> 00:10:54.942
Employers no longer suppress unions

00:10:54.983 --> 00:10:57.611
by hiring private armies,

00:10:57.611 --> 00:11:01.824
like US Steel, Ford
and the coal companies did.